    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>You have 60 seconds to set up your side of the board, then, the game begins</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366590/extras/718aab3d9cb28f5dc1b67c5e20f590bf.poster.avif?t=1741787348\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366590/extras/718aab3d9cb28f5dc1b67c5e20f590bf.webm?t=1741787348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366590/extras/718aab3d9cb28f5dc1b67c5e20f590bf.mp4?t=1741787348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Advance your way up the board, capturing territory</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366590/extras/23f7051af2695b74ada920d8dcf94473.poster.avif?t=1741787348\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366590/extras/23f7051af2695b74ada920d8dcf94473.webm?t=1741787348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366590/extras/23f7051af2695b74ada920d8dcf94473.mp4?t=1741787348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Deploy your forces across a compact battlefield</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366590/extras/f375c23a385dd4d71bb3848e67a1de1f.poster.avif?t=1741787348\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366590/extras/f375c23a385dd4d71bb3848e67a1de1f.webm?t=1741787348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366590/extras/f375c23a385dd4d71bb3848e67a1de1f.mp4?t=1741787348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Attack and discover your opponent's pieces</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366590/extras/95672cfce575ddae77355a7d5811dd33.poster.avif?t=1741787348\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366590/extras/95672cfce575ddae77355a7d5811dd33.webm?t=1741787348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366590/extras/95672cfce575ddae77355a7d5811dd33.mp4?t=1741787348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Unleash powerful supports to turn the tide of battle mid-game</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366590/extras/349a7adc8d40f53ccff17f5e03cdf8ef.poster.avif?t=1741787348\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366590/extras/349a7adc8d40f53ccff17f5e03cdf8ef.webm?t=1741787348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366590/extras/349a7adc8d40f53ccff17f5e03cdf8ef.mp4?t=1741787348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From air-striking your opponent's General to airlifting your Flag out of danger. Each piece has unique ranks and abilities letting you craft devious strategies to outmaneuver your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional strategy games, you can continue deploying reinforcements throughout the match, adapting your tactics as your opponent's army is gradually revealed. Will you play it safe and defend, or risk it all on an aggressive push to capture the enemy's flag?</p>",
