uver your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional strategy games, you can continue deploying reinforcements throughout the match, adapting your tactics as your opponent's army is gradually revealed. Will you play it safe and defend, or risk it all on an aggressive push to capture the enemy's flag?</p>",
